{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01","cat":"favorite","group":{"id":"fav5014","label":"Julia"},"label":"The Musician of the Wasteland","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"treasurestory_julia_02","speakers":{"julia":"Julia"},"icons":{"julia":"si_c150_00_s"},"notes":["Favorite item quest step: Go to the surface with Julia"],"lines":[{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_1","text":"♬♪♩♬♪♩♬♪♩","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WasteLand_02_n","bgArt":"wasteland_02_n","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_frostpillar","movie":null,"shown":["julia"],"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_2","text":"Today's melody has a particularly beautiful resonance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_3","text":"It's like a lone cactus flower blooming amidst a barren wasteland.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_4","text":"My music must have taken on that rugged tone while performing in the harsh environment of the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_5","text":"I feel quite satisfied.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_6","text":"Now then, shall I play the next piece?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_7","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_7","text":"*Rustle*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_8","text":"Ah... this piece!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_9","text":"I found this lying forgotten in the ruins, waiting for someone to play it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_10","text":"The score which originally carried that composer's hopes and dreams crumbled away soon after,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_11","text":"but I was able to give a new home to those notes with this notebook.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_12","text":"If I hadn't done so...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_13","text":"This beauty might have remained lost forever, fallen into oblivion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_14","text":"I wish to convey the joy of that moment of discovery to the one who composed it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_15","text":"I will perform it with this joy in my heart.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_16","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_16","text":"♬♪♩♬♪♩♬♪♩","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_17","text":"Will it reach them, I wonder?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_18","text":"... No. I have a long journey yet to travel before I reach such an echelon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_19","text":"Until then, I must keep improving.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_20","text":"If I continue forging ahead, one day I am sure to reach that stratum.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_21","text":"And when that day comes, I hope that my melodies will surge forth and reach them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_22","text":"Let us leave our doubts and regrets behind, and move forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_23","text":"*Rustle*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_24","text":"Ah...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_25","text":"So that piece was the last one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_26","text":"Come to think of it, that was the most recent one I transcribed into this notebook.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_27","text":"There are still a few pages left, however.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_28","text":"Enough to fit at least one more composition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_29","text":"It's a bit disappointing that I couldn't fill it entirely, but I cannot break my promise to Mentor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_30","text":"I must visit the Ark once a month.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_31","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_31","text":"Julia lifts her head and looks around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_32","text":"The wilderness is already bathed in a crepuscular glow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_33","text":"It was also dusk when the Conductor first blessed the initial step of my journey.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_34","text":"This scenery reminds me of then.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_35","text":"... For the final piece, perhaps I'll play the melody that I want to convey the most.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_36","text":"I shall perform once more, while I recall that precise point in time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_37","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_37","text":"♬♪♩♬♪♩♬♪♩","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_01_38","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_01_38","text":"*Screech*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgAr